{"id":"9f8586e4baa616ce","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-godel-system-definition.md","title":"Gödel System Definition","display":"df-godel-system-definition — Gödel System Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-godel-system-definition","aliases":["90-df-godel-system-definition"],"display":"df-godel-system-definition — Gödel System Definition","depends_on":["[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-godel-system-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-godel-system-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-system-definition — Gödel System Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是下式指定的句子公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\sigma\">\\(G\\vdash\\sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的推导关系，而非再把定理闭包当作新的公理呈现。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span> 满足上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> 必须是同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span>、同一指定变量的实际代入函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G\\)</span> 必须由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 对该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,g\">\\(G,g\\)</span> 及固定公理验证程序构造，不是任取一个二元关系。故呈现包含该验证程序的固定选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (effective arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (axiom set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span> (candidate encoding and partial decoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> (coded substitution function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G\\)</span> (external proof-code relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span> (Gödel-system presentation, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ax}_G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ax}_G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}system\\text{-}definition}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathcal G\\coloneqq\n(S,\\operatorname{Ax}_G,g,d,\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}system\\text{-}definition}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathcal G\\coloneqq\n(S,\\operatorname{Ax}_G,g,d,\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{G}\">\\(\\mathcal{G}\\)</span> : Gödel系统 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"7eb380164954dfb8\" href=\"?note=7eb380164954dfb8\" title=\"90-df-godel-system\">90-df-godel-system</a>)</li>\n<li>该六元组显式记录语言、公理、编码/部分解码、代入与外部证明码检验；内部证明公式由表示性条件提供。</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"7eb380164954dfb8\" href=\"?note=7eb380164954dfb8\" title=\"90-df-godel-system\">90-df-godel-system</a> 对这种数据施加有效性、一致性与算术强度条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ 是下式指定的句